<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>PAL Block Canvas - 초간편 비주얼 블록 빌더</title>
    <!-- Tailwind CSS -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <!-- Lucide Icons -->
    <script src="https://unpkg.com/lucide@latest"></script>
    <!-- SweetAlert2 -->
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/sweetalert2@11"></script>
    
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fira+Code:wght@400;500&family=Pretendard:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap');
        
        :root {
            --primary: #2563eb;
            --primary-light: #eff6ff;
            --grid-color: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.08);
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Pretendard', sans-serif;
            background-color: #f8fafc;
            color: #1e293b;
        }
        
        .code-font {
            font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace;
        }

        /* Blueprint Canvas Grid Background (White Mode) */
        .blueprint-canvas {
            background-color: #ffffff;
            background-image: 
                linear-gradient(to right, var(--grid-color) 1px, transparent 1px),
                linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--grid-color) 1px, transparent 1px);
            background-size: 20px 20px;
        }

        /* Beautiful Scrollbar */
        ::-webkit-scrollbar {
            width: 6px;
            height: 6px;
        }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
            background: #f1f5f9;
        }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
            background: #cbd5e1;
            border-radius: 3px;
        }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {
            background: #94a3b8;
        }

        /* Block Highlight Action */
        .block-running {
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.5);
            transform: scale(1.02);
            transition: all 0.2s ease-out;
        }

        /* Block Drop Shadow & Hover effect */
        .block-card {
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.05), 0 2px 4px -2px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.05);
            transition: transform 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease;
        }
        .block-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 15px -3px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.08), 0 4px 6px -4px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.08);
        }
        
        /* Smooth transitions for container reordering */
        .layout-transition {
            transition: order 0.3s ease, min-width 0.3s ease, width 0.3s ease;
        }

        /* [블록 크기 조절 시스템] */
        #workspace-canvas.size-small .canvas-block-instance {
            padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            border-radius: 0.5rem;
        }
        #workspace-canvas.size-small .canvas-block-instance input,
        #workspace-canvas.size-small .canvas-block-instance select {
            padding: 0.125rem 0.25rem;
            font-size: 10px;
            width: 6.5rem;
        }
        #workspace-canvas.size-small .canvas-block-instance span {
            font-size: 10px;
        }
        #workspace-canvas.size-small .canvas-block-instance svg {
            width: 14px;
            height: 14px;
        }

        #workspace-canvas.size-large .canvas-block-instance {
            padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
            gap: 1.5rem;
            border-radius: 1.5rem;
        }
        #workspace-canvas.size-large .canvas-block-instance input,
        #workspace-canvas.size-large .canvas-block-instance select {
            padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem;
            font-size: 13px;
            width: 10rem;
        }
        #workspace-canvas.size-large .canvas-block-instance span {
            font-size: 13px;
        }
        #workspace-canvas.size-large .canvas-block-instance svg {
            width: 20px;
            height: 20px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="h-screen overflow-hidden flex flex-col">

    <!-- 1. 게이트웨이 화면 (로그인 및 안전한 접속 가드) -->
    <div id="auth-gate" class="fixed inset-0 bg-slate-100 z-50 flex items-center justify-center p-4 transition-all duration-300">
        <div class="absolute w-96 h-96 bg-blue-300/20 rounded-full blur-3xl top-1/4 left-1/4 pointer-events-none animate-pulse"></div>
        <div class="absolute w-96 h-96 bg-indigo-300/20 rounded-full blur-3xl bottom-1/4 right-1/4 pointer-events-none animate-pulse" style="animation-delay: 2s;"></div>

        <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-3xl p-8 w-full max-w-lg shadow-2xl relative z-10 flex flex-col max-h-[90vh] overflow-y-auto">
            <div class="text-center mb-6">
                <div class="inline-flex p-3.5 bg-gradient-to-tr from-blue-600 to-indigo-600 rounded-2xl mb-4 text-white shadow-md shadow-blue-500/10">
                    <i data-lucide="toy-brick" class="w-8 h-8 animate-bounce"></i>
                </div>
                <h1 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight">PAL Block Canvas</h1>
                <p class="text-slate-500 text-xs mt-1.5 leading-relaxed">비주얼 블록 조립으로 다루는 세상에서 가장 쉬운 파이어베이스 실시간 DB & Gemini AI</p>
            </div>

            <!-- 소셜 계정 로그인 버튼 -->
            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 mb-4">
                <button onclick="handleSocialSignIn('Google')" class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-white hover:bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 text-slate-700 font-bold py-2.5 px-4 rounded-xl shadow-sm transition-all text-xs">
                    <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                        <path fill="#EA4335" d="M12.24 10.285V13.4h6.887C18.2 15.614 15.645 18 12.24 18c-3.86 0-7-3.14-7-7s3.14-7 7-7c1.7 0 3.3.6 4.6 1.7l2.4-2.4C17.3 1.5 14.9.8 12.24.8c-5.5 0-10 4.5-10 10s4.5 10 10 10c5.8 0 9.7-4.1 9.7-9.9 0-.6-.1-1.2-.2-1.7H12.24z"/>
                    </svg>
                    Google 로그인
                </button>

                <button onclick="handleSocialSignIn('Whale')" class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-[#00c73c]/5 hover:bg-[#00c73c]/10 border border-[#00c73c]/30 text-[#00b135] font-bold py-2.5 px-4 rounded-xl shadow-sm transition-all text-xs">
                    <i data-lucide="compass" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
                    Whale 로그인
                </button>
            </div>

            <div class="relative flex items-center py-2 mb-4">
                <div class="flex-grow border-t border-slate-200"></div>
                <span class="flex-shrink mx-3 text-slate-400 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">또는 개발자 수동 연결</span>
                <div class="flex-grow border-t border-slate-200"></div>
            </div>

            <!-- 실시간 DB 주소 입력 및 설정 영역 -->
            <form id="db-setup-form" onsubmit="handleManualConnect(event)" class="space-y-4">
                <div>
                    <label class="block text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">실시간 DB 주소 직접 입력하기</label>
                    <input type="url" id="db-address" required placeholder="https://your-rtdb-project.firebaseio.com/" class="block w-full bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl px-3 py-2.5 text-xs text-slate-700 focus:outline-none focus:bg-white focus:border-blue-500 transition-all font-mono">
                </div>
                <div>
                    <label class="block text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">인증 토큰 (선택사항)</label>
                    <input type="password" id="db-token" placeholder="Database Secret 토큰 기입" class="block w-full bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl px-3 py-2.5 text-xs text-slate-700 focus:outline-none focus:bg-white focus:border-blue-500 transition-all">
                </div>

                <div class="pt-1">
                    <p class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-bold mb-2">원클릭 빠른 데모 연결</p>
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2">
                        <button type="button" onclick="loadPreset('pal-coop')" class="flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 py-2 px-1 border border-slate-200 hover:border-blue-500 rounded-lg text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-600 hover:text-blue-600 transition-all bg-slate-50 hover:bg-blue-50/20">
                            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>
                            PAL 협업 기본 DB
                        </button>
                        <button type="button" onclick="loadPreset('demo-sandbox')" class="flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 py-2 px-1 border border-slate-200 hover:border-blue-500 rounded-lg text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-600 hover:text-blue-600 transition-all bg-slate-50 hover:bg-blue-50/20">
                            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500"></span>
                            테스트용 데모 DB
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <button type="submit" class="w-full bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800 text-white font-bold py-3 px-4 rounded-xl text-xs transition-all flex items-center justify-center gap-2 shadow-sm">
                    <i data-lucide="plug" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
                    데이터베이스 수동 연결하기
                </button>
            </form>

            <div class="relative flex items-center py-2 my-2">
                <div class="flex-grow border-t border-slate-100"></div>
                <span class="flex-shrink mx-3 text-slate-300 text-[9px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">강력 추천 모드</span>
                <div class="flex-grow border-t border-slate-100"></div>
            </div>

            <!-- 즉시 시작 로컬 시뮬레이터 -->
            <button onclick="startLocalSimulator()" class="w-full bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-indigo-600 hover:from-blue-700 hover:to-indigo-700 text-white font-extrabold py-3 px-4 rounded-xl text-xs tracking-wide transition-all flex items-center justify-center gap-2 shadow-lg shadow-blue-500/15 active:scale-[0.99]">
                <i data-lucide="monitor-play" class="w-4.5 h-4.5 animate-pulse"></i>
                로컬 시뮬레이터로 즉시 사용 (추천 🌟)
            </button>

            <p class="text-center text-[10px] text-slate-400 mt-5 leading-relaxed">
                사용자 개인 정보와 로그인 세션은 웹 브라우저 내부에만 안전하게 암호화 보관됩니다.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 2. 메인 어플리케이션 인터페이스 헤더 -->
    <header class="bg-white border-b border-slate-200 px-6 py-4 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between shrink-0 gap-4 z-10">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="p-2.5 bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-600 to-indigo-600 rounded-2xl text-white shadow-lg shadow-blue-500/15">
                <i data-lucide="toy-brick" class="w-6 h-6"></i>
            </div>
            <div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                    <h2 class="font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight text-sm">PAL Block Canvas</h2>
                    <span id="sync-badge" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[10px] font-bold bg-blue-50 text-blue-600 border border-blue-100">
                        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-blue-500 rounded-full animate-pulse"></span>
                        온라인 연동 중
                    </span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-1 text-[11px] text-slate-500 mt-0.5 font-mono">
                    <span id="active-db-url" class="truncate max-w-[280px] font-medium">연결되지 않음</span>
                    <button onclick="handleSignOut()" class="text-rose-500 hover:text-rose-700 font-bold hover:underline ml-1">
                        끊기
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 레이아웃 조절용 컨트롤 패널 -->
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 flex-wrap">
            <div class="bg-slate-100 p-1 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 flex items-center gap-1 text-xs">
                <span class="px-2 py-1 text-[9px] font-extrabold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-widest">배치:</span>
                <button onclick="toggleSidebarLayout()" class="px-2.5 py-1 bg-white hover:bg-slate-50 text-slate-700 rounded-lg text-[10px] font-bold transition-all shadow-xs flex items-center gap-0.5">
                    <i data-lucide="layout-sidebar" class="w-3 h-3 text-blue-600"></i>
                    보관함 좌/우
                </button>
                <button onclick="togglePreviewLayout()" class="px-2.5 py-1 bg-white hover:bg-slate-50 text-slate-700 rounded-lg text-[10px] font-bold transition-all shadow-xs flex items-center gap-0.5">
                    <i data-lucide="layout-panel-right" class="w-3 h-3 text-indigo-600"></i>
                    가이드 좌/우
                </button>
            </div>

            <!-- 로그인 소속 배지 -->
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl">
                <div id="user-avatar" class="w-6.5 h-6.5 rounded-xl bg-blue-600 text-white font-extrabold flex items-center justify-center text-xs shadow-sm">
                    U
                </div>
                <div class="text-left hidden sm:block">
                    <p id="user-name" class="text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-800">방문자님</p>
                    <p id="user-auth-badge" class="text-[9px] text-slate-400 font-mono">게스트 계정</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- 3. 메인 작업 구역 (왼쪽 블록 보관함 / 중간 블록 조립 캔버스 / 오른쪽 데이터 프리뷰) -->
    <div class="flex-1 flex overflow-hidden w-full relative">
        
        <!-- [A] 블록 보관함 (Palette) - Flex Order 1 -->
        <aside id="palette-aside" class="layout-transition w-72 bg-white border-r border-slate-200 flex flex-col shrink-0 overflow-hidden order-1">
            <div class="p-4 border-b border-slate-200 bg-slate-50/50">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                    <h3 class="text-xs font-black text-slate-600 uppercase tracking-widest flex items-center gap-1.5">
                        <i data-lucide="layout-grid" class="w-4 h-4 text-blue-600"></i>
                        블록 보관함
                    </h3>
                    <span id="palette-count" class="text-[10px] bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full font-bold font-mono">32 Blocks</span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 mt-1">블록을 클릭하면 오른쪽 작업판에 추가됩니다.</p>
                
                <!-- 블록 실시간 검색창 도입 -->
                <div class="relative mt-3">
                    <input type="text" id="palette-search" placeholder="블록 이름이나 기능 검색..." oninput="filterPalette()" class="w-full pl-8 pr-3 py-1.5 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl text-xs focus:outline-none focus:border-blue-500 font-medium">
                    <i data-lucide="search" class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-slate-400 absolute left-2.5 top-2.5"></i>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 카테고리별 아코디언식 블록 스크롤 컨테이너 -->
            <div class="flex-1 overflow-y-auto p-4 space-y-4" id="palette-container">
                <!-- JS에서 총 32개 이상의 블록이 분류별로 자동 렌더링됩니다. -->
            </div>
            
            <div class="p-3 bg-slate-50 border-t border-slate-200 text-[10px] text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
                💡 <strong>블록 순서 정렬:</strong> 각 블록의 상/하 화살표를 누르면 실행 순서를 변경할 수 있습니다.
            </div>
        </aside>

        <!-- [B] 비주얼 블록 조립 캔버스 (Canvas Workspace) - Flex Order 2 -->
        <section id="workspace-section" class="layout-transition flex-1 flex flex-col bg-slate-50 overflow-hidden relative blueprint-canvas order-2 border-r border-l border-slate-200/50">
            
            <!-- 캔버스 컨트롤 바 -->
            <div class="bg-white border-b border-slate-200 px-6 py-2.5 flex items-center justify-between shrink-0 z-10 shadow-xs flex-wrap gap-2">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
                        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-blue-600"></span>
                        <h3 class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-700">캔버스 프로그램 조립소 (Canvas)</h3>
                    </div>
                    
                    <!-- [블록 크기 조절 시스템] UI 토글 -->
                    <div class="bg-slate-100 p-0.5 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 flex items-center gap-1 text-[10px]">
                        <span class="px-1.5 font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase">크기:</span>
                        <button onclick="changeBlockSize('small')" id="btn-size-small" class="px-2 py-0.5 hover:bg-white/80 text-slate-600 rounded font-semibold transition-all">작게</button>
                        <button onclick="changeBlockSize('medium')" id="btn-size-medium" class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-white text-blue-600 rounded font-bold shadow-xs transition-all">보통</button>
                        <button onclick="changeBlockSize('large')" id="btn-size-large" class="px-2 py-0.5 hover:bg-white/80 text-slate-600 rounded font-semibold transition-all">크게</button>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- 실행 및 세이브, 블록 JSON 가져오기/내보내기 버튼 -->
                <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
                    <!-- [블록 설정 JSON 넣기 빼기] -->
                    <button onclick="importBlocksFromJson()" class="px-2.5 py-1.5 bg-slate-50 hover:bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl text-[10px] font-bold transition-all flex items-center gap-1" title="블록 파일 가져오기 (넣기)">
                        <i data-lucide="folder-input" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"></i>
                        가져오기 (JSON)
                    </button>
                    <button onclick="exportBlocksToJson()" class="px-2.5 py-1.5 bg-slate-50 hover:bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl text-[10px] font-bold transition-all flex items-center gap-1" title="블록 파일 내보내기 (빼기)">
                        <i data-lucide="folder-output" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"></i>
                        내보내기
                    </button>
                    <div class="h-6 w-px bg-slate-200 mx-1"></div>
                    <button onclick="clearWorkspace()" class="px-3 py-1.5 bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 text-slate-600 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold transition-all flex items-center gap-1">
                        <i data-lucide="trash-2" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"></i>
                        비우기
                    </button>
                    <button onclick="executeBlockProgram()" class="px-4 py-1.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-indigo-600 hover:from-blue-700 hover:to-indigo-700 text-white rounded-xl text-xs font-bold transition-all flex items-center gap-1.5 shadow-md shadow-blue-500/10">
                        <i data-lucide="play" class="w-4 h-4 fill-white animate-pulse"></i>
                        프로그램 실행
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 블록들이 조립되는 작업판 (기본크기: medium) -->
            <div id="workspace-canvas" class="flex-1 overflow-y-auto p-6 space-y-3 relative size-medium">
                <!-- 빈 화면일 때 친근한 가이드 제공 -->
                <div id="canvas-empty-state" class="absolute inset-0 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-slate-400 text-center select-none p-12">
                    <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-blue-50 border border-blue-100 rounded-3xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-blue-500 shadow-sm">
                        <i data-lucide="toy-brick" class="w-8 h-8"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="font-extrabold text-slate-700 text-sm">조립판이 비어 있습니다!</h4>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1 max-w-sm leading-relaxed">원하는 카테고리의 블록을 좌측에서 넣어 프로그램을 완성해 보세요. 새롭게 추가된 <strong>[인공지능 & Gemini API]</strong> 블록을 활용하면 똑똑한 LLM 연동 프로그램도 손쉽게 구현할 수 있습니다!</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- [C] 실시간 DB 데이터 뷰어 & 실행 터미널 로그 & Gemini API 가이드 - Flex Order 3 -->
        <aside id="preview-aside" class="layout-transition w-80 bg-white border-l border-slate-200 flex flex-col shrink-0 overflow-hidden order-3">
            
            <!-- 우측 사이드바 상단 탭 스위치 -->
            <div class="bg-slate-50 border-b border-slate-200 flex shrink-0">
                <button onclick="switchAsideTab('database')" id="aside-tab-db" class="flex-1 py-3 text-center text-xs font-bold border-b-2 border-blue-600 text-blue-600 transition-all flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5">
                    <i data-lucide="database" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"></i>
                    모니터링
                </button>
                <button onclick="switchAsideTab('gemini')" id="aside-tab-gemini" class="flex-1 py-3 text-center text-xs font-bold border-b-2 border-transparent text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-800 transition-all flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5">
                    <i data-lucide="sparkles" class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-blue-500 animate-pulse"></i>
                    Gemini AI 비서
                </button>
            </div>

            <!-- 패널 1: 데이터베이스 및 모니터링 터미널 -->
            <div id="aside-panel-database" class="flex-1 flex flex-col overflow-hidden">
